        "id": "intro-comment",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Pitch a Voice Up\n\nRaises the pitch of a voice by a set number of semitones without changing its length. It is the counterpart to time stretching.\n\n**How it works:** The \"Audio\" input goes to \"Up 4 semitones\", which shifts the pitch up by four semitones. \"Result\" plays the shifted audio. It runs locally with no model or key.\n\n**Try this:** Set semitones on \"Up 4 semitones\" to -5 to drop the voice lower instead."
        },
